Ninja: {
	Dialogue: {
		// MyName: My name is {0} and I'm ninja. And in gratitude I can teach you how to be ninja as well!
		// Basic1: I have no idea how I ended up being trapped within that giant slimy creature. The last thing I remember is taking on a strange-looking crown I found.
		// Basic2: When you fight your enemy, you must always be prepaired to die. Always go all in.
		// Basic3: Clear your mind! There's only you and your foe. Nothing else matters!
		// Basic4: Your techique is lacking. Train harder!
		// Basic5: You can copy my technique all you want. Without understanding you will remain an amateur.
		// Basic6: Always remember what you are fighting for!
		// Special1: I cannot belive {0} thinks I'm not Japanese enough! I know about Japan more than anyone else!
		// BloodMoon1: Let them come. I'll show them power of the ninja!
		// BloodMoon2: Let's get this party started!
		// BloodMoon3: It is time to sharpen my ninja skills!
		// Evil: I can sense demons lurking around...
		// Night: Each time I look into the night sky, I wonder what shall the new dawn bring us?
		// Rain1: Let the rain wash away your anger and sorrow.
		// Rain2: The summer rain is always so warm and soothing...
		// Thunderstorm1: I always wanted to become as fast as the lightning. I must train harder!
		// Thunderstorm2: Do you hear that? Raiden is furious.
		// Wind1: Death is like the wind - always by my side.
		// Windy31: Follow the wind, but watch your back.
		// Graveyard1: This place smells like a battlefield...
		// Graveyard2: The death takes on guise of the crow.
		// Exhausted: ...Where am I? Am I finally free? You! Arigato for saving me!
	}

	Mood: {
		// NoHome: Don't mind me, I'm just a ronin looking for a way home.
		// DislikeCrowded: There are too many people around! I cannot meditate properly.
		// LoveSpace: Such a calm and delightful day in the dojo...
		// LoveBiome: There's nothing more beautiful than a forest during sakura blossom season! I feel myself truly at home.
		// LikeBiome: This place reminds me of the mountain Fuji's peak. I like it here.
		// DislikeBiome: The moisture here makes my armor rust. And rusty armor is a shame for any warrior!
		// HateBiome: I'm barelly keeping my sakura bonsai alive! This place is the dead and dry wasteland and there's nothing beatiful about it.
		// LoveNPC: At last, I've finally been able to reunite with my dear brother. All thanks to you!
		// LikeNPC: Both I and {NPCName} share love for a good drink. Though he certainly lacks a sophistication to really get into sake.
		// DislikeNPC: How dares {NPCName} make fun of my ninjutsu? Firearms will never replace a cold steel!
		// Content: I feel inner peace.
		// LikeNPC_Princess: I showed her highness, {NPCName} - sama, my manga collection and it made her so excited! I feel flattered!
		// Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is so cool and I love his comic books!"
	}

